Assistant: I understand the issue now - we can't override module exports directly as they are read-only. Instead, we'll need to create a wrapper component that provides mock values through context or by mocking the hooks at a higher level. Let me try a different approach using React Context to provide the mock values:

<file path="/Users/nim/src/customers/campsite/apps/web/.temp/dessn-component-routes/OrganizationIntegrationsPage-b28dfeb6.tsx">
